					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871012,
					"content": "難怪你沒有自己去抓它…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871013,
					"content": "欸嘿，總之幫了大忙啦，那我先走啦…阿、阿嚏——",
